            "icon_width": 24,
            "heading": "How Big Patches Can You Make?",
            "content": "<p>You can create patches up to2 x 2 inches (5.2 x 5.2 cm) whenusing all 14 top hooks. Using fewer hooks allows you to makesmaller patches as needed.</p>",
