        "liquid": "<style>\n.review-wrap {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n.review-card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.review-img {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\n.review-body {\n  padding: 18px 16px;\n}\n.star {\n  color: #f5a623;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n}\n.review-title {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  margin: 8px 0 12px;\n}\n.review-text {\n  color: #444;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\n.review-name {\n  margin-top: 16px;\n  color: #555;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n.section-main-title {\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 36px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 990px) {\n  .review-wrap {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  }\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .review-wrap {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n<h2 class=\"section-main-title\">Customer Reviews</h2>\n<div class=\"review-wrap\">\n  <!-- Card 1 -->\n  <div class=\"review-card\">\n    <img class=\"review-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0778/4352/9959/files/11111.jpg?v=1794514318\" alt=\"customer review\">\n    <div class=\"review-body\">\n      <div class=\"star\">★★★★★</div>\n      <div class=\"review-title\">Getting Better</div>\n      <div class=\"review-text\">just got mine and used it to make two patches today. I’m getting better at it.</div>\n      <div class=\"review-name\">Tami J.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Card 2 -->\n  <div class=\"review-card\">\n    <img class=\"review-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0778/4352/9959/files/22222_e9d0c887-33ff-4823-a480-957f8d80bbbd.jpg?v=1794514317\" alt=\"customer review\">\n    <div class=\"review-body\">\n      <div class=\"star\">★★★★★</div>\n      <div class=\"review-title\">First Patch Complete</div>\n      <div class=\"review-text\">My first patch is done 😊 It was really fun. Looking forward to exploring more patterns in the future.</div>\n      <div class=\"review-name\">Demi R.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Card 3 -->\n  <div class=\"review-card\">\n    <img class=\"review-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0778/4352/9959/files/33333.jpg?v=1794514318\" alt=\"customer review\">\n    <div class=\"review-body\">\n      <div class=\"star\">★★★★★</div>\n      <div class=\"review-title\">feels so calming</div>\n      <div class=\"review-text\">It took a bit of patience at first, but now it feels so calming and relaxing. I’ve been doing it on and off for the past month. The video tutorials really helped. Now I’m looking forward to trying some new patterns.</div>\n      <div class=\"review-name\">Isabela S.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Card 4 -->\n  <div class=\"review-card\">\n    <img class=\"review-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0778/4352/9959/files/44444444444.jpg?v=1794514319\" alt=\"customer review\">\n    <div class=\"review-body\">\n      <div class=\"star\">★★★★★</div>\n      <div class=\"review-title\">Clever Idea</div>\n      <div class=\"review-text\">Very clever idea. Reminds me of what my grandmother used to use, but much simpler. I do wish the hooks were a bit longer for thicker fabric, but overall I’m thrilled with it!</div>\n      <div class=\"review-name\">Barbara T.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Card 5 -->\n  <div class=\"review-card\">\n    <img class=\"review-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0778/4352/9959/files/55555555.jpg?v=1794514318\" alt=\"customer review\">\n    <div class=\"review-body\">\n      <div class=\"star\">★★★★★</div>\n      <div class=\"review-title\">So Far, So Good</div>\n      <div class=\"review-text\">My third patch so far! Looks really nice. Works great on my old denim jeans. I’m planning to try some knitwear tomorrow 😊 It takes a bit of practice, but I’m really enjoying it.</div>\n      <div class=\"review-name\">George Hall H.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Card 6 -->\n  <div class=\"review-card\">\n    <img class=\"review-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0778/4352/9959/files/666666_8f835285-cf7c-471e-b55b-a6b896ed869c.jpg?v=1794514318\" alt=\"customer review\">\n    <div class=\"review-body\">\n      <div class=\"star\">★★★★★</div>\n      <div class=\"review-title\">Perfect Gift</div>\n      <div class=\"review-text\">I bought one for my wife’s birthday last month and she was absolutely stoked. These are her jeans now. I’ve honestly never seen her enjoy doing something for this long. Yesterday it was raining and she spent the whole day weaving patches. Such a cool gift!</div>\n      <div class=\"review-name\">Sean G.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Card 7 -->\n  <div class=\"review-card\">\n    <img class=\"review-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0778/4352/9959/files/7777777.jpg?v=1794514318\" alt=\"customer review\">\n    <div class=\"review-body\">\n      <div class=\"star\">★★★★★</div>\n      <div class=\"review-title\">So Relaxing</div>\n      <div class=\"review-text\">Absolutely love it! The meditative aspect is real. I just put on a podcast, start weaving, and the world melts away. It’s been really helping with my anxiety in the evenings.</div>\n      <div class=\"review-name\">Natacha A.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Card 8 -->\n  <div class=\"review-card\">\n    <img class=\"review-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0778/4352/9959/files/8888.jpg?v=1794514318\" alt=\"customer review\">\n    <div class=\"review-body\">\n      <div class=\"star\">★★★★★</div>\n      <div class=\"review-title\">Better Than Expected</div>\n      <div class=\"review-text\">I’ve been using mine for a few weeks and finally tried one of the patch designs from the booklet. It turned out way better than I expected!</div>\n      <div class=\"review-name\">Susan D.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
